<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Nov jobless rises to 12.17 pct (12.01 Oct).</title>
<headline>Slovak Nov jobless rises to 12.17 pct (12.01 Oct).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in Slovakia in November totalled 312,452, or 12.17 percent of the workforce, up from 12.01 percent in October, the Ministry of Labour said on Monday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT RATE   NOV 1996  OCT 1996   NOV 1995</p>
<p> Total jobless		  312,452    308,416   326,279</p>
<p> Percentage of workforce     12.17	12.01     12.80</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
